---
title: AI feature — Natural-language event creation
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor O as Organizer (browser)
  participant C as Controller<br/>Server Action parseEventText
  participant R as RateLimiter<br/>(Postgres)
  participant S as ParseEventTextService
  participant M as Claude Haiku<br/>(structured output)
  participant Z as Zod schema<br/>(same as manual form)

  O->>C: text + timezone field (prefilled from browser Intl)
  C->>C: require session (Organizer only)
  C->>R: consume("ai:user:{id}", 20/day)
  alt limit exceeded
    R-->>C: denied
    C-->>O: "Daily AI limit reached — fill the form manually"
  else allowed
    C->>S: parse(text, timezone, now)
    Note over S: Timezone priority:<br/>1. explicit in text ("7pm EST")<br/>2. form field (browser prefill)<br/>3. none → missing["timezone"]
    S->>M: prompt + context "Today is Thu 2026-09-24 23:00, America/Fortaleza"<br/>timeout 10s
    alt timeout or API error
      M-->>S: error
      S-->>O: "Couldn't fill automatically — please fill the form"
    else structured response
      M-->>S: { name, description, date, time, timezone, location }
      S->>Z: validate
      Z-->>S: valid fields + missing[]
      S-->>C: ParseResult
      C-->>O: fill form · highlight missing fields
    end
  end
  Note over O,Z: The AI never saves. The Organizer reviews and clicks Save.
